# Go build and test artifacts
*_binary
# `go build main.go` inside a cmd directory drops a binary called `main`.
# Scoped to the Go tree: as a bare pattern this matched *any* path segment named
# `main`, which silently excluded source directories elsewhere in the repo.
backend/**/main
coverage.out
*.test

